<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px7" title="In 5.5 Workflow Events ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 4: A4 SSP build</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px8" title="In 5.5 Workflow Events ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 4a: Human compliance lead approval</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px9" title="In 5.5 Workflow Events ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 5: A5 capsule + 3PAO SAR</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px10" title="In 5.5 Workflow Events ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 5a: 3PAO Human SAR Approval</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS5.SSS0.Px11" title="In 5.5 Workflow Events ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 6: Agency AO ATO decision</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS6" title="In 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.6 </span>Call Chain Verification</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS6.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.6 Call Chain Verification ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 1: Actor Authenticity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS6.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.6 Call Chain Verification ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 2: Proof Server Attestation.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS6.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.6 Call Chain Verification ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 3: Proof Server Signature.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS6.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.6 Call Chain Verification ‣ 5 Framework: Lineage Registration and Verification ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 4: Workflow Integrity.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
