<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS6.SSS0.Px2" title="In Future Considerations ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Approach.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS6.SSS0.Px3" title="In Future Considerations ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Verification.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS6.SSS0.Px4" title="In Future Considerations ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Optional attestation.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS6.SSS0.Px5" title="In Future Considerations ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Properties &amp; trade-offs.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS6.SSS0.Px6" title="In Future Considerations ‣ Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Scope.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Context Lineage Assurance for Non-Human Identities in Critical Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
